WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.145
Your team's day is split across five different apps.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.252
Today, that ends. Meet TeamUp. One place for your whole team.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.111
Messages land the moment you send them. Replies and reactions arrive live.

4
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.233
One tap, and the whole channel is on a call.

5
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:26.561
When the call ends, AI writes the minutes. Decisions, action items, and who owns each one.

6
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.689
Work moves across one board the whole team can see.

7
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.475
Meetings and focus time live on one calendar.

8
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.728
Managers set up daily stand-ups that only their own team can see.

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.443
Find anything in seconds. On your laptop, or on your phone.

10
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.496
And here is the difference. TeamUp runs on your own server. Your data never leaves it.

11
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:58.549
You pay for one server, not for every seat. Two processors carried about five hundred busy people.

12
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.245
One command sets it all up. And it's open source.

13
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.531
TeamUp. Your team. Your server. Your data.
